# App HFSM integration

## Wiring

- Entry: `main.tscn` → `src/game/main.gd`
- Config: `src/game/hfsm/app_hfsm.json`
- Paths: `HfsmScenePaths`
- Bridge: `RootEvents.ev_*` → `hfsm.add_event` on **app_root**
- Entities: `main.gd` registers `{ "context": { DesktopContext, AndroidContext, SteamContext, WEBContext, YandexGamesContext } }`
- Contexts live in `src/game/contexts/`

## Scenes

- `app_root` → saves + event bridge + host platform open (`ev.open_*`)
- `menu` / `game` / `post_battle`
- Start payload: `{ "custom_battle": GameConfig }` (`vs_ai` inside)

## Platform open (AppRoot)

| Host | Event | State |
|------|-------|-------|
| Steam feature | `ev.open_steam` | `STEAM` |
| Android | `ev.open_android` | `ANDROID` |
| Web / Yandex | `ev.open_web` | `WEB` (+ nested `YandexGames` if yandex) |
| Else | `ev.open_desktop` | `DESKTOP` |

## Must

- Keep match `GameManager` FSM separate from HFSM
- New app phase → JSON `scene` + `HfsmScenePaths` export
- Platform auth/SDK only in context entities — do not duplicate Menu scenes
